    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_class1d_eve09",
      "hash64": "E309C8AF3BF5C3B9",
      "text": "比起宝可梦对战，\\n我更喜欢疼爱宝可梦。\\c\\n给宝可梦洗澡澡的话，\\n连我都会有疗愈的感觉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_class1d_eve10",
      "hash64": "E30D55AF3BF8E927",
      "text": "既有像帕奇利兹那样\\n不会进化的宝可梦，\\c\\n又有像伊布那样\\n会各种进化的宝可梦哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
